WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.620
how do you stay motivated and how do you
motivate people when they start to slack

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:17.070
now motivation is it's kind of a strange
word because it doesn't really mean what

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:25.050
we think it means we think it means that
we're fired up to do something we think

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:33.110
that it means we're eager and passionate
to make something happen

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:40.800
and we think that somehow we should just
be able to turn on that eagerness and

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:51.780
turn on that passion but we can't
because you just can't turn on passion

00:00:51.780 --> 00:01:01.320
you can't just turn on the desire to
execute a task just doesn't work that

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:10.110
way and honestly that isn't even what
motivate means motivate doesn't mean to

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:20.310
yell and scream and encourage no to
motivate actually means to provide a

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:31.890
motive a reason why so to motivate
someone is to explain to them why

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:38.040
they're doing what they're doing how it
will help them where it'll take them why

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:46.439
they should continue to work in the
struggle and to fight and when you need

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:53.070
motivation yourself look for someone to
scream and yell don't look for someone

00:01:53.070 --> 00:02:01.159
else to give you motivation look at you

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:13.819
look at yourself and remind yourself why
why you are doing what you are doing

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:24.150
remind yourself that this struggle this
temporary pain this fight this fight

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:32.430
that you're in this is what will make
you stronger and faster and smarter and

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:51.319
better and then with that motivation go
forward into the fray into the storm

00:02:51.319 --> 00:03:03.049
into the heat of the battle where
victory is forged

